      "type": "text",
      "text": "DA antagonists (ex, neuroleptics · metoclopramide) may reduce ropinirole's efficacy & may diminish pramipexole's. Ropinirole = met by CYP1A2: cipro ↑its levels & smoke = expected to ↑its clearance; adjust dose when potent CYP1A2 inducer or inhibitor = started or stopped"
